--- /dev/null
+++ b/doc/whatsnew/fragments/7228.bugfix
@@ -0,0 +1,7 @@
+Pylint now reports a clean error, instead of crashing with a traceback, when a
+configuration option expecting a regular expression (for example
+``function-rgx``) contains an invalid pattern such as ``\p{Han}``. The optional
+``regex`` module is used as a fallback when it is installed, allowing those
+patterns to work.
+
+Closes #7228
